### The code below assigns a null object to the vector, numbers, and initiates an empty vector which will be populated in the next line of code inside a for loop. There is no command to print results, so the command will run in the background and nothing is printed.

```{r, eval=TRUE, echo=TRUE, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE, class.source = "fold-show", fig.height=5, fig.width=8, results='show', cache=FALSE}

